WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.046
Tina: We lost him!

2
00:00:13.047 --> 00:00:15.129
Brad: This isn’t good.

3
00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:18.287
Danny: We’re terrible babysitters.

4
00:00:18.288 --> 00:00:23.196
Tina: Let’s go find him!

5
00:00:23.197 --> 00:00:25.764
Danny: He can’t be that far away.

6
00:00:25.766 --> 00:00:33.675
Brad: We’re doomed if someone sees him!

7
00:00:33.676 --> 00:00:38.286
Tina: This is very, very bad!

8
00:00:38.287 --> 00:00:39.667
Bello: Boo!

9
00:00:39.668 --> 00:00:40.905
Mr. Smith: Very funny.

10
00:00:40.906 --> 00:00:43.343
Listen. I don’t know who you are.

11
00:00:43.344 --> 00:00:46.981
Mr. Smith: But that drop sheet belongs in the art classroom.

12
00:00:46.982 --> 00:00:49.758
Bello: Boo!

13
00:00:49.759 --> 00:00:52.358
Danny: What are we going to do?

14
00:00:52.359 --> 00:00:55.158
Brad: We’ve got to do something!

15
00:00:55.159 --> 00:00:58.192
Tina: Do you think Bello can see us?

16
00:00:58.193 --> 00:01:01.187
Danny: Maybe. Why?

17
00:01:01.188 --> 00:01:02.825
Mr. Smith: It’s not funny.

18
00:01:02.826 --> 00:01:07.332
Mr. Smith: If I lift this sheet, Danny'd better not be underneath.

19
00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:12.249
Mr. Smith: If that is you, Danny, you should be in music class now.

20
00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:19.074
Danny: I’m in such trouble!

21
00:01:19.075 --> 00:01:26.481
Tina: Quick. Do what I do!

22
00:01:26.482 --> 00:01:31.469
Bello: Dance.

23
00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:35.140
Danny: It’s working.

24
00:01:35.141 --> 00:01:37.152
Mr. Smith: You’re lucky that I’m late.

25
00:01:37.153 --> 00:01:43.723
Take that sheet back to the art room!

26
00:01:43.724 --> 00:01:46.121
Danny: That was great work, Tina!

27
00:01:46.122 --> 00:01:49.940
Tina: My baby brother loves it when I make crazy faces.

28
00:01:49.941 --> 00:01:51.871
Brad: You heard Mr. Smith.

29
00:01:51.872 --> 00:01:58.916
Back to the art room!

30
00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:01.427
Tina: Now, Bello, stay.

31
00:02:01.428 --> 00:02:06.914
Bello: Stay.

32
00:02:06.915 --> 00:02:10.673
Brad: We’ve got to find a way back to Ginormous.

33
00:02:10.674 --> 00:02:13.880
Danny: But Tristay took the magic clay.

34
00:02:13.881 --> 00:02:17.199
Tina: What if we paint a key rainbow colors.

35
00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.717
Danny: We don’t have magic paint.

36
00:02:19.718 --> 00:02:24.644
Brad: So . . . so we are stuck here.

37
00:02:24.645 --> 00:02:28.439
Danny: No. There’s got to be a way back.

38
00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:32.073
Brad: But how?

39
00:02:32.074 --> 00:02:35.633
Danny: There’s got to be a clue . . . or something.

40
00:02:35.634 --> 00:02:41.901
Danny: I wish Hopian would show up with more magic clay.

41
00:02:41.902 --> 00:02:44.975
Danny: Not now, Bello. We’re thinking.

42
00:02:44.976 --> 00:02:48.960
Brad: Yes. This is going to take some serious thought.

43
00:02:48.961 --> 00:02:50.648
Bello: Clay.

44
00:02:50.649 --> 00:02:53.314
Danny: What did you say?

45
00:02:53.315 --> 00:02:57.318
Tina: Look in his hand!

46
00:02:57.319 --> 00:03:00.262
Danny: It’s magic clay!

47
00:03:00.263 --> 00:03:04.128
Bello: Clay! Clay!
